 NoOrYesAutoPress;myGuiParms;parms
⍝ Simple "No-or-Yes" dialog that presses the "Cancel" button automatically
 myGuiParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 parms←##.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForNoOrYes
 parms.timeout←3
 parms.autoPress←1
 ⎕←parms myGuiParms ##.GUI.Dialogs.NoOrYes'Are you really sure?'
